message:
The `apply_coupon` function in `shop/pricing.py` did a bare dict lookup (`COUPONS[code]`) with no guard, so an empty or unknown code raised an unhandled `KeyError` that propagated through `cart.total()`. Fixed with a one-line validation guard that raises `ValueError` instead. Added `tests/test_issue_1.py` covering empty code and unknown code at both the `apply_coupon` and `cart.total()` levels; full suite green (35 passed).
@m13-board
RESULT
```json
